e too surprised to find out that the arrangement of the spheres and their mostly subtle effects could influence those born under them, in a slight way. We somewhat recently found out about <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toxoplasma_gondii\" target=\"_blank\">toxoplasma gondii</a> and while that's a more obvious biological influence, it's been affecting folks for thousands of years without anyone the wiser. So I like to keep my options open, though again if there is an influence I expect it to be slight.<br /> <br /> That said from another angle I could see it as an easy way to keep information about the age of people who couldn't keep track of time themselves by people who had the ability to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-25T17:55:26-07:00","id":678366,"title":"","content":"Capricorn/Aquarius, Year of the Yang Water Dog<br /> <br /> (You can figure out my date of birth just based on that. ))","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-25T23:58:28-07:00","id":678598,"title":"","content":"Today(9/25) was my 35 birthday. Libra, year of the Monkey/Yang/Metal. That was a Koshin year, which is supposed to be very bad luck: <a href=\"http